<title>USA: First Washington files for offering.</title>
<headline>First Washington files for offering.</headline>
<dateline>BETHESDA, Md. 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Washington Realty Trust Inc said Thursday it has filed a shelf registration statement with the Securities and Exchange Commission for the registration of up to an aggregate of $175,000,000 of common shares, preferred shares, debt securities and warrants.</p>
<p>The trust said it would use the net proceeds from the sale of any securities for general business purposes, including the acquisition of additional shopping centers, the renovation and expansion of certain properties and the repayment of debt.</p>
</text>
